---

<BaseLayout
  title="How BIM and Digital Twins Are Redefining Project Delivery in AEC | Sniper Systems"
  description="Discover how BIM and Digital Twin technologies are transforming AEC project delivery, collaboration, and asset lifecycle management using Autodesk solutions."
  keywords="BIM digital twins, AEC technology, Autodesk BIM, construction digital twin, architecture engineering India, Autodesk Tandem, Revit BIM"
  ogImage={OG_IMAGE}
  ogType="article"
  publishedTime={PUBLISHED}
  author={AUTHOR}
